flowchart TB
 Internet --> FW[Default-deny firewall]
 FW --> WAF[Web application firewall]
 WAF --> WEB[HTTPS web application]
 WEB --> DB[(Database - private network)]
 SENSOR[Network IDS sensor] -. monitor mirrored traffic .-> FW
 LOGS[Centralized logs and alerts] <-- SENSOR
 ADMIN[Authorized administrators] --> MFA[MFA and least privilege]
 MFA --> WEB
